      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The option is intended to be 0 MB, making everyone a fallback avatar.\n\nThe previous wording of \"No Limit\" was misleading and a lot of people thought it meant \"Unlimited\", so it got changed to 0 MB.\n\nIf you want a unlimited value, you must instead set the value really high. \n\nSet Download size to 200 MB\n\nSet Uncompressed size to 500 MB\n\nThese are the max size that avatars are allowed to be as of writing.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
