      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2cc9743e5e4b3102c1074e|full_name} Thank you very much. I now have a much clearer understanding.\n\nActually, I had been chatting with a friend who had set this option to 0 MB, and after rejoining him a short while later, it seemed like the setting suddenly took effect. He mentioned that \"everyone’s avatars are now fallback avatars,\" which left me quite puzzled. Now that I understand it was due to this setting, it all makes sense.\n\nNow that I know, it’s not really a problem. I’ll share this information within the community as a helpful note about this setting. Thanks again!",
